sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Nhan vien / Admin (Role: Staff / Admin)
    participant UI as React Web App (Back-office Dashboard)
    participant Ctrl as RecyclerApplicationsController
    participant Svc as RecyclerOnboardingService
    participant Mail as GmailSmtpEmailService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    Staff->>+UI: 1. Mo trang Quan ly Ho so Nang cap Co so Thu mua (Loc Status = Pending)
    UI->>+Ctrl: 2. GET /api/v1/recycler-applications?status=Pending&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. GetApplicationsForStaffAsync(filter, ct)
    Svc->>+DB: 4. SELECT * FROM recycler_profiles JOIN users WHERE verification_status = 'Pending'
    DB-->>-Svc: 5. Return Paged List of RecyclerProfiles
    Svc-->>-Ctrl: 6. Return PagedResult<RecyclerApplicationDetailDto>
    Ctrl-->>-UI: 7. 200 OK: ApiResponse<PagedResult>
    UI-->>-Staff: 8. Hien thi danh sach ho so & anh Giay phep kinh doanh / Toa do GPS

    Staff->>+UI: 9. Kiem tra chung tu & Bam 'Phe duyet (Approve)' hoac 'Tu choi (Reject)'
    UI->>+Ctrl: 10. PUT /api/v1/recycler-applications/{userId}/verification (VerifyRecyclerApplicationRequest)
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 11. VerifyApplicationAsync(staffUserId, targetUserId, request, ct)
    Svc->>+DB: 12. SELECT * FROM recycler_profiles JOIN users WHERE user_id = @targetUserId
    DB-->>-Svc: 13. Return profile & user

    alt Tu choi nhung khong nhap ly do (IsApproved == false & RejectionReason == empty - Vi pham BR-MTH-02)
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 14a. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-MTH-02", "MSG-MTH-05")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 15a. 400 Bad Request: Bat buoc phai nhap ly do tu choi (BR-MTH-02)
        UI-->>Staff: 16a. Yeu cau Staff nhap ly do tu choi (>= 10 ky tu)
    else Phe duyet Ho so (IsApproved == true)
        Note over Svc: 1. profile.VerificationStatus = Verified<br/>2. Nang cap user.Role = UserRole.Recycler (Citizen -> Recycler)
        Svc->>+DB: 14b. UPDATE recycler_profiles SET verification_status = 'Verified' & UPDATE users SET role = 'Recycler'
        DB-->>-Svc: 15b. 2 rows affected (Commit Transaction)
        Svc->>+Mail: 16b. SendEmailAsync(user.Email, "Chuc mung! Ho so Co so thu mua da duoc duyet - MSG-MTH-04")
        Mail-->>-Svc: 17b. Sent SMTP Email
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 18b. Return RecyclerApplicationDetailDto (CurrentRole = "Recycler", VerificationStatus = "Verified")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 19b. 200 OK: ApiResponse (MSG-MTH-04)
        UI-->>Staff: 20b. Thong bao phe duyet thanh cong (User chinh thuc tro thanh Recycler)
    else Tu choi Ho so hop le (IsApproved == false & Co RejectionReason - BR-MTH-02)
        Note over Svc: 1. profile.VerificationStatus = Rejected<br/>2. Luu profile.RejectionReason, giu nguyen user.Role = Citizen
        Svc->>+DB: 14c. UPDATE recycler_profiles SET verification_status = 'Rejected', rejection_reason = @reason
        DB-->>-Svc: 15c. 1 row affected
        Svc->>+Mail: 16c. SendEmailAsync(user.Email, "Thong bao ket qua tham dinh kem ly do tu choi - MSG-MTH-05")
        Mail-->>-Svc: 17c. Sent SMTP Email
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: 18c. Return RecyclerApplicationDetailDto (CurrentRole = "Citizen", VerificationStatus = "Rejected")
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 19c. 200 OK: ApiResponse (MSG-MTH-05)
        UI-->>-Staff: 20c. Cap nhat trang thai Rejected (Cho phep Citizen sua va Re-apply)
    end

